# Figma Plugin Rules (Enforcement-First)

Follow these rules. Violations are caught by ESLint and build validator.

## Rule 0: themeColors
showUI(..., { themeColors: true });

## Rule 1: Colors (var(--figma-color-*) ONLY)
Never: hex, rgb, hsl, named colors.
Always: var(--figma-color-text), var(--figma-color-bg), etc.

Semantic pairing:
- bg-brand → text-onbrand
- bg-success → text-onsuccess
- bg-warning → text-onwarning
- bg-danger → text-ondanger

## Rule 2: Typography
fontSize → lineHeight: 10px→16px, 11px→16px, 12px→16px, 13px→20px
Always set both when setting fontSize.

## Rule 3: Spacing
4px, 8px, 16px, 24px only. Use Stack/Container/Inline with space="small|medium|large".

## Rule 4: Scrollable
Add paddingBottom: '16px' to scrollable content.

## Components
@create-figma-plugin/ui: Button, Textbox, Text, Stack, Container, Inline, VerticalSpace
@inversestudio/figma-ui-components: NativeText, SemanticBadge (pre-validated)

## Docs
See docs/QUICK-REFERENCE.md and docs/LLM-ERROR-GUIDE.md in project root.
